title: $:/plugins/mblackman/media-importer/readme

! Media Importer

[[GitHub Repository|https://github.com/mblackman/tiddlywiki-media-importer]]

Manage your media consumption within TiddlyWiki

This plugin allows you to search and import metadata for various media types into your TiddlyWiki.

!! Supported Sources
* ''Books'': OpenLibrary
* ''Comics'': ComicVine (Requires API Key)
* ''Games'': RAWG (Requires API Key)
* ''Manga'': AniList
* ''Movies'': TMDB (Requires API Key)
* ''Music'': MusicBrainz + Cover Art Archive
* ''TV Shows'': TMDB (Requires API Key)

!! Setup

After installing, please go to the ''$:/plugins/mblackman/media-importer'' > ''config'' to configure your API keys.

!! Usage

Create a new tiddler for media imports and paste the text: `{{$:/plugins/mblackman/media-importer/ui}}`.

To create the library browser, create a tiddler with this text: `{{$:/plugins/mblackman/media-importer/ui/media-library}}` (or use `<$MediaLibrary />`).

To create a dedicated backlog manager for ranking, prioritizing, and triaging your backlog queue, use `{{$:/plugins/mblackman/media-importer/ui/media-backlog}}` (or `<$MediaBacklog />`).

!! Widgets

* ''Media Picker'': Log media consumption for a specific date.
** `<$MediaPicker date="YYYY-MM-DD" />` (Defaults to today if no date is provided)

* ''Media Consumption Summary'': View a summary of consumed media within a date range.
** `<$MediaConsumptionSummary startDate="YYYY-MM-DD" endDate="YYYY-MM-DD" />`
** Key attributes: `startDate`, `endDate`, `readonly`.

* ''Media Importer UI'': The core search and import interface used to build custom importer tabs.
** `<$MediaImporter type="Book" placeholder="Search books..." resultTag="SearchResult" />`
** Key attributes: `type` (required), `resultTag` (required), `placeholder`, `loadingText`, `imageField`, `subtitleContent`.

* ''Media Library'': Browse and filter your imported media collection.
** Tiddler: [[$:/plugins/mblackman/media-importer/ui/media-library]]
** You can add a toolbar button from the tools menu to quickly access the library.

* ''Media Backlog'': Rank (`#1`–`#N`), filter by length/commitment, add recommender notes, and pick what to consume next.
** Tiddler: [[$:/plugins/mblackman/media-importer/ui/media-backlog]] (`<$MediaBacklog />`)
** Includes a PageControls toolbar button (`$:/plugins/mblackman/media-importer/ui/toolbar-media-backlog`).
